<title>FINLAND: Finnish May industrial output up 6.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish May industrial output up 6.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production adjusted for working days increased 6.1 percent year-on-year in May compared to a 7.9 percent rise in April, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		    May 1997    April 1997   May 1996</p>
<p>		    +6.1 pct     +7.9 pct    +2.9 pct</p>
<p>The average of six economists' forecasts was for a growth rate of 7.4 percent (range 6.7-8.3 percent).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358-0-680 50 245, news@reuters@.fi</p>
